	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Generic .NET reflection and reference-lifetime helpers. Distinguish borrowed objects, passthrough aliases and acquired metadata or boxed return handles. Close acquired references after use; dispose enumerators where supported before closing their handles. No Windows notification policy is imposed by this library.</Property>
